  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COGER AZRAG AINOU RURAL ELECTRIFICATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Compagnie Generale des Energies Renouvelables (COGER) aims to address the lack of access to energy for 340 households in the Azrag Ainou region. The grant will fund the construction of solar photovoltaic infrastructure to generate and distribute off-grid electricity.</narrative>
